WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.180
<b>Class 3-B</b>

00:05.030 --> 00:07.430
Morning, Komura-kun.

00:07.430 --> 00:09.150
Morning, Mie-san.

00:09.610 --> 00:10.690
Your glasses...

00:10.690 --> 00:11.580
Yeah.

00:11.580 --> 00:14.660
I think it was when I took them off 
because they got fogged up from my cocoa.

00:15.180 --> 00:16.740
Then, well...

00:16.740 --> 00:18.950
Wanna share textbooks today?

00:21.250 --> 00:22.340
Thanks.

00:29.680 --> 00:32.710
<i>Mie-san's in a good mood lately.</i>

00:33.340 --> 00:36.500
<i>And her hairstyle is super cute,</i>

00:36.500 --> 00:38.350
<i>although I don't know what it's called.</i>

00:46.490 --> 00:49.030
Wh-Wh-What?!

00:49.030 --> 00:50.000
Nothing.

00:50.000 --> 00:51.730
I just wanted to see your face.

01:00.750 --> 01:01.890
<i>Good mood...</i>

01:01.890 --> 01:05.710
<i>Or rather, even weirder than before.</i>

01:06.180 --> 01:08.050
<i>Then again, maybe she's 
always been like that.</i>

01:08.050 --> 01:09.000
Hey, hey, Komura.

01:10.020 --> 01:12.310
Umm... Someya-san.

01:13.280 --> 01:15.820
Were you just kissing Mie-san?

01:18.180 --> 01:19.470
Smooch.

01:33.740 --> 01:34.820
The Girl I Like 
her Glasses

01:34.820 --> 01:37.830
The Girl I Like 
Forgot her Glasses

02:56.520 --> 02:58.800
Were you just kissing Mie-san?

03:00.520 --> 03:01.540
Smooch.

03:03.540 --> 03:07.920
Episode 10

03:03.540 --> 03:07.920
The Girl I Like Had a Request

03:12.510 --> 03:16.190
Again, she was just getting up close to him.

03:16.190 --> 03:19.920
Haven't you seen her do that all the 
time when she forgets her glasses?

03:20.490 --> 03:21.930
Sorry, Komura-kun.

03:22.260 --> 03:24.930
Aw, so you haven't?

03:24.930 --> 03:26.810
N-No way.

03:26.810 --> 03:28.250
Really?

03:28.250 --> 03:29.490
Come on, let's go.

03:29.490 --> 03:32.810
Why would they do that at school, anyway?

03:30.980 --> 03:32.810
<i>Is that how people see us?</i>

03:32.810 --> 03:35.010
I was so sure they did...

03:35.010 --> 03:35.940
Sure, sure.

03:36.880 --> 03:38.820
<i>No, that's not good.</i>

03:38.820 --> 03:41.670
<i>That kind of misunderstanding is 
going to be an annoyance to Mie-san.</i>

03:54.660 --> 03:56.490
Was that Someya-san?

03:58.910 --> 03:59.870
What's wrong?

03:59.870 --> 04:01.590
You're groaning.

04:06.230 --> 04:08.100
U-Um...

04:09.660 --> 04:12.680
Sorry, I'm kinda sick.

04:12.680 --> 04:15.330
I don't want you to catch it.

04:20.290 --> 04:21.320
Found it.

04:21.320 --> 04:22.740
Th-Thanks.

04:23.210 --> 04:26.240
<i>A mask from Mie-san's bag...</i>

04:27.900 --> 04:29.740
<i>I just lied to her.</i>

04:29.740 --> 04:32.250
<i>But how am I supposed to explain?</i>

04:33.450 --> 04:35.570
U-Um...

04:35.570 --> 04:38.250
I might still spread it to you...

04:39.790 --> 04:41.460
<i>This is awkward.</i>

04:42.630 --> 04:45.130
<b>Music Room</b>

04:45.130 --> 04:46.940
<i>I'm sorry, Mie-san!</i>

04:45.640 --> 04:49.640
Stare

04:46.940 --> 04:49.640
<i>I'm not trying to be mean or anything!</i>

04:49.640 --> 04:53.270
Stare

04:50.650 --> 04:52.710
<i>People are getting the wrong idea!</i>

04:53.270 --> 04:55.770
<b>Stare...</b>

04:54.690 --> 04:55.770
<i>See? They're staring.</i>

04:55.770 --> 05:00.400
Stare...

04:56.240 --> 04:57.420
<i>They're staring!</i>

04:57.420 --> 04:58.300
Knock it off.

04:58.300 --> 05:00.400
They're staaaaring!

05:00.400 --> 05:04.900
<b>Staaaare</b>

05:00.820 --> 05:04.900
<i>Although, why does Mie-san 
want to see my face so badly?</i>

05:10.110 --> 05:15.090
I've never seen dating 
type stuff in real life.

05:15.090 --> 05:17.380
I got so excited.

05:17.380 --> 05:18.540
Um...

05:18.540 --> 05:20.290
You really didn't kiss?

05:20.970 --> 05:22.320
We didn't.

05:22.320 --> 05:25.300
I promise I won't tell anyone.

05:28.510 --> 05:31.310
Mie-chan, you should stay 
focused. It's dangerous.

05:31.940 --> 05:32.770
Yeah.

05:34.510 --> 05:35.230
Squish.

05:35.230 --> 05:36.680
I swear...

05:39.130 --> 05:40.650
M-Mie-san?!

05:41.680 --> 05:44.330
Mie-san, are you all right?

05:44.330 --> 05:45.610
I-I'm fine.

05:45.610 --> 05:47.580
My vision's just fuzzy.

05:47.580 --> 05:49.160
That's your default.

05:49.160 --> 05:52.660
<b>Nurse's Office</b>

05:50.080 --> 05:52.660
Keep that on there for a while.

05:52.660 --> 05:55.070
Take a short break, 
then go back to class.

05:56.660 --> 05:58.170
Ice pack

05:56.810 --> 05:58.170
You can take the ice pack with you.

05:58.580 --> 05:59.800
Got it.

06:00.780 --> 06:02.140
Thanks.

06:02.950 --> 06:04.460
For coming with me.

06:05.010 --> 06:06.910
I-It's fine.

06:07.700 --> 06:09.760
<i>Was I supposed to come?</i>

06:10.960 --> 06:12.040
You got this.

06:13.300 --> 06:16.090
<i>I hope people don't get the wrong idea again.</i>

06:17.020 --> 06:18.720
Kissing Mie-san!

06:18.840 --> 06:20.760
Kissing Mie-san!

06:20.860 --> 06:23.020
Kissing Mie-san!

06:23.020 --> 06:24.710
<i>Forget about that!</i>

06:24.710 --> 06:26.600
<i>Get it out of your head for a second!</i>

06:30.090 --> 06:32.570
W-Wanna head back now?

06:35.840 --> 06:38.660
What do you do on the weekends?

06:40.220 --> 06:42.800
Wh-What do you mean?

06:42.800 --> 06:46.420
Chores, studying, gaming, I guess.

06:46.740 --> 06:49.440
You said you like coin games, right?

06:49.440 --> 06:50.890
Yeah.

06:50.890 --> 06:52.390
I go to the arcade a lot, too.

06:53.130 --> 06:54.340
Lucky.

06:54.340 --> 06:59.890
I'm not allowed to go 
unless I go with my dad.

07:00.270 --> 07:02.390
I go in secret sometimes, though.

07:02.390 --> 07:06.900
<i>I've noticed Mie-san's 
pretty sheltered.</i>

07:07.650 --> 07:08.530
S-So...

07:09.650 --> 07:12.160
Why do you ask?

07:13.190 --> 07:15.160
I just wanted to talk.

07:18.040 --> 07:21.490
We haven't got to talk too much today.

07:21.490 --> 07:25.170
You've been hanging out 
with Someya-san all day.

07:31.880 --> 07:33.680
Never mind.

07:34.780 --> 07:35.930
<i>She's right.</i>

07:36.340 --> 07:41.730
<i>I might have neglected Mie-san because 
I was so worried about Someya-san.</i>

07:41.730 --> 07:44.700
<i>Mie-san's struggling without her glasses.</i>

07:47.590 --> 07:50.240
Hey, Komura-kun...

07:50.460 --> 07:51.740
Y-Yeah?

07:52.270 --> 07:56.120
Just once each day, whenever 
I forget my glasses,

07:56.120 --> 07:59.400
can I look at your face from up close?

08:01.200 --> 08:03.710
I've been thinking about it,

08:03.710 --> 08:06.250
and I can't help but want to see 
your face at least once a day.

08:08.480 --> 08:11.380
I want to see your face.

08:11.380 --> 08:14.380
<i>I want to see your face.</i>

08:14.380 --> 08:16.800
<i>I want to see your face.</i>

08:16.800 --> 08:19.390
Wh-Why, though?

08:20.280 --> 08:24.300
<i>Actually, I guess it's more reassuring to 
be able to see someone's face than not.</i>

08:27.920 --> 08:31.610
<i>I must have made her anxious.</i>

08:33.480 --> 08:35.020
It's okay if you don't want me to.

08:35.020 --> 08:37.120
I-I don't mind.

08:42.120 --> 08:44.610
I-I totally don't mind.

08:45.580 --> 08:51.880
I wouldn't mind you looking at 
my face as much as you want.

08:54.880 --> 08:57.300
<i>Man, that came out weird.</i>

08:57.890 --> 09:00.740
I-I can look as much as I want?

09:00.740 --> 09:01.420
Eh?

09:07.190 --> 09:09.590
I won't do it too much, though.

09:09.590 --> 09:11.690
R-Right.

09:18.200 --> 09:21.160
<i>H-How many seconds has it been?</i>

09:22.200 --> 09:24.120
<i>How many minutes?</i>

09:24.120 --> 09:26.210
<i>My hands are getting sweaty.</i>

09:27.060 --> 09:30.550
<i>Is my face really that calming?</i>

09:39.710 --> 09:42.270
<i>It's fine, though. She seems happy.</i>

09:59.000 --> 10:01.060
Thanks for helping with the cleaning.

10:01.060 --> 10:02.350
It's okay.

10:02.350 --> 10:03.480
Wanna go home?

10:05.080 --> 10:06.890
Wait, wait, wait!

10:06.890 --> 10:08.580
Whoa, you scared me.

10:08.580 --> 10:10.270
S-Sorry.

10:10.270 --> 10:11.920
It's a bit of an emergency.

10:11.920 --> 10:13.140
Your hair...

10:13.140 --> 10:15.270
Your hair's stuck.

10:18.040 --> 10:20.900
<i>Mie-san's cute, beautiful hair!</i>

10:23.670 --> 10:25.920
Wait, please no!

10:25.920 --> 10:27.560
I think it's tangled.

10:28.060 --> 10:29.770
Do you have scissors?

10:32.210 --> 10:34.180
Y-You're cutting it?

10:34.180 --> 10:35.100
Yeah.

10:35.100 --> 10:36.230
Clean off?

10:36.230 --> 10:37.070
Yeah.

10:37.070 --> 10:38.780
I can't see what's going on.

10:44.830 --> 10:46.260
I'd like to do it.

10:46.260 --> 10:47.760
You'll cut it for me?

11:01.380 --> 11:04.130
You can just go ahead, now.

11:04.700 --> 11:06.310
<i>But I can't.</i>

11:06.310 --> 11:10.700
<i>I have to... I have to minimize the damage!</i>

11:10.700 --> 11:15.050
I used to cut it pretty often before.

11:15.050 --> 11:17.820
But people said I should grow it out.

11:19.610 --> 11:23.860
They like my hair.

11:26.490 --> 11:28.830
Do you, Komura-kun?

11:38.660 --> 11:39.850
S-Sorry.

11:39.850 --> 11:41.470
Were you saying something?

11:44.340 --> 11:47.510
I'll take better care of my hair.

11:51.720 --> 11:53.720
Y-Yeah.

12:20.580 --> 12:22.880
I dropped my hairband.

12:22.880 --> 12:24.050
Where did it go?

12:26.570 --> 12:27.590
Found it.

12:32.710 --> 12:35.170
Could you do up my hair, Komura-kun?

12:36.370 --> 12:39.150
I've never done it before, though.

12:39.150 --> 12:41.530
There's a first time for everything.

12:48.700 --> 12:52.090
<i>I love the way she thinks, but...</i>

13:02.240 --> 13:04.430
Tell me if it hurts.

13:04.430 --> 13:05.260
Okay.

13:05.260 --> 13:07.020
D-Does it hurt?

13:07.830 --> 13:09.890
You're getting too nervous.

13:09.890 --> 13:11.240
B-But...

13:11.240 --> 13:12.830
It's fine.

13:13.760 --> 13:16.860
Do you usually do this yourself?

13:16.860 --> 13:18.210
Usually.

13:18.210 --> 13:21.150
Mom does it for me, too.

13:26.020 --> 13:27.610
Is that good?

13:27.610 --> 13:28.410
Yeah.

13:29.330 --> 13:30.780
You're good at this.

13:31.090 --> 13:32.490
Thank you.

13:34.280 --> 13:36.540
If only it were like this every morning.

13:39.490 --> 13:42.570
Y-You mean, if I tied it 
up for you every morning?

13:43.160 --> 13:43.920
Yeah.

13:43.920 --> 13:46.420
B-But at school?

13:46.870 --> 13:47.860
Nah.

13:56.410 --> 13:57.940
Someday.

13:58.370 --> 14:03.940
<i>"Yeah" to what and "Nah" to what?</i>

14:12.380 --> 14:14.260
<i>The cultural festival's coming up.</i>

14:15.670 --> 14:19.700
<i>So we're all staying at school to prepare.</i>

14:20.420 --> 14:26.340
<i>It's always fun preparing for something, 
whatever that something is.</i>

14:26.340 --> 14:27.920
Komura-kun.

14:28.420 --> 14:30.470
<i>Especially with Mie-san here.</i>

14:30.470 --> 14:32.180
Can I help with something?

14:32.460 --> 14:34.930
You should wash your hands first.

14:37.370 --> 14:41.190
I was making decorations 
with newspapers just now.

14:41.730 --> 14:43.520
I-I see.

14:43.520 --> 14:44.840
You have some on your face, too.

14:47.920 --> 14:49.270
Is it off?

14:49.270 --> 14:49.950
Yeah.

14:57.130 --> 14:59.550
Are you tired, Komura-kun?

14:59.550 --> 15:00.810
Wanna take a break?

15:01.960 --> 15:03.960
Y-Yeah, I think so.

15:03.960 --> 15:06.420
I think I'll take a break 
after I'm done pasting these.

15:07.980 --> 15:09.970
That was so funny!

15:16.420 --> 15:18.650
<i>Why is she still here?</i>

15:18.650 --> 15:20.980
<i>Is she out of stuff to do?</i>

15:21.810 --> 15:23.880
Do I just glue these together?

15:25.100 --> 15:25.730
Yeah.

15:37.300 --> 15:39.390
<i>It's dry by the time she puts it on.</i>

15:42.860 --> 15:45.150
<i>I guess she wants to be doing something.</i>

15:45.150 --> 15:47.210
<i>Mie-san's a hard worker.</i>

15:47.880 --> 15:49.590
I'll put the glue on.

15:49.590 --> 15:51.970
Could you just paste it together?

15:52.330 --> 15:53.220
Makes sense.

15:53.220 --> 15:54.750
It's a partnership.

16:03.820 --> 16:04.930
Here, Mie-san.

16:04.930 --> 16:06.220
Gotcha!

16:11.640 --> 16:12.990
Wrong side!

16:12.990 --> 16:14.880
S-Sorry.

16:14.880 --> 16:16.680
Hold still for a second.

16:16.680 --> 16:18.200
My apologies.

16:18.200 --> 16:19.490
No, err...

16:20.130 --> 16:21.930
I messed up the hand-off.

16:23.420 --> 16:27.250
Mie-san, they're still making 
newspaper decorations.

16:29.750 --> 16:31.100
<i>Huh?</i>

16:31.100 --> 16:33.510
<i>Is it not that she wants something to do?</i>

16:34.510 --> 16:36.510
<i>Is she bored of making decorations?</i>

16:38.990 --> 16:40.020
Um...

16:40.720 --> 16:44.830
Let me know when you're done pasting 
and you're going to take a break.

16:47.350 --> 16:48.550
Like this?

16:49.730 --> 16:51.090
Can I join?

16:51.090 --> 16:52.470
Welcome.

16:52.470 --> 16:53.280
Welcome.

17:00.380 --> 17:02.750
<i>She wants to take a break with me?</i>

17:03.150 --> 17:04.790
<i>No, no...</i>

17:04.790 --> 17:06.120
<i>Overconfidence is evil.</i>

17:06.940 --> 17:11.630
<i>She's just trying to get me 
to rest because she's nice.</i>

17:15.100 --> 17:17.780
I-I'm gonna get some glue.

17:17.780 --> 17:18.540
Sure.

17:27.530 --> 17:29.610
Wh-What's up?

17:30.350 --> 17:32.610
I wanna go with you.

17:36.810 --> 17:39.160
I-It's getting dark in the hallway.

17:39.160 --> 17:40.340
Be careful.

17:41.620 --> 17:45.620
<b>Art Prep Room</b>

17:43.850 --> 17:45.620
It might be locked.

17:47.140 --> 17:48.980
Oh, good, it's not.

17:51.140 --> 17:52.430
Is no one here?

17:53.180 --> 17:54.380
I guess not.

17:55.240 --> 17:57.240
Wait, Mie-san.

17:57.240 --> 17:58.680
We gotta turn on the glasses.

18:10.400 --> 18:12.910
E-Err, the lights...

18:14.000 --> 18:17.000
I haven't had a chance to get a good look.

18:17.000 --> 18:18.150
Can I?

18:21.680 --> 18:26.990
<i>Right, she said she wanted to look at 
my face when she forgets her glasses.</i>

18:27.620 --> 18:29.920
Th-That's fine, but...

18:30.980 --> 18:33.920
Isn't this a bit too sensitive a location?

18:35.150 --> 18:37.650
Err, I'm kinda thinking...

18:37.650 --> 18:39.930
Maybe we should do this somewhere else.

18:45.930 --> 18:50.600
I-I think it might be better 
where no one else is around.

19:04.070 --> 19:06.230
<i>W-Wait a second...</i>

19:06.230 --> 19:08.620
<i>Is this why she was trying 
to get me to take a break?</i>

19:09.050 --> 19:14.630
<i>Then again, it's true that she wouldn't want 
anyone else noticing us and getting the wrong idea.</i>

19:15.860 --> 19:20.020
<i>I'm the one being creepy, wondering 
if it's too sensitive or whatever.</i>

19:21.280 --> 19:22.920
W-Well, okay.

19:23.590 --> 19:25.270
Go ahead.

19:25.270 --> 19:26.640
Thanks.

19:26.640 --> 19:28.140
I'll make sure it's over quick.

19:28.140 --> 19:29.660
<i>Warrior speak!</i>

19:34.600 --> 19:35.770
So dark.

19:35.770 --> 19:37.650
<i>Yeah, I bet it is.</i>

19:44.160 --> 19:50.160
<i>She gets anxious on days she forgets her 
glasses, because she can't see her friends.</i>

19:50.760 --> 19:53.630
<i>But she feels better when she 
can see someone's face up close.</i>

19:54.550 --> 19:57.670
<i>That's what she realized recently.</i>

19:58.240 --> 20:01.300
<i>That's why she wants to see my face.</i>

20:03.300 --> 20:05.840
Komura-kun, look at me.

20:08.760 --> 20:11.170
Sorry, can I see your face?

20:13.440 --> 20:15.550
<i>That's all it is.</i>

20:29.860 --> 20:32.960
<i>Am I allowed to think....</i>

20:34.260 --> 20:40.190
<i>she thinks I'm special to her?</i>

20:45.490 --> 20:47.140
T-Time's up.

20:49.480 --> 20:50.970
Thanks.

20:52.000 --> 20:57.710
<i>What am I to Mie-san, exactly?</i>

21:06.080 --> 21:08.230
What took you so long?

21:08.230 --> 21:09.740
S-Sorry.

21:10.370 --> 21:15.500
Komura-kun, you should go wash your face.

21:17.530 --> 21:20.500
Mie-chan, your hands are all black!

21:18.500 --> 21:21.130
I mean, your face is all black.

21:21.130 --> 21:22.070
Again?

21:22.070 --> 21:24.970
You were touching newspapers again earlier.

21:28.360 --> 21:29.440
Hey...

21:29.440 --> 21:30.360
It's not...

21:30.360 --> 21:31.730
It's not, okay?

21:31.730 --> 21:32.970
Not what?

23:10.670 --> 23:12.060
Komura Kaede here.

23:12.060 --> 23:13.910
I'm going to do the next episode preview.

23:13.910 --> 23:17.500
"Komura-kun and Mie-san prepare 
for the cultural festival."

23:17.500 --> 23:19.120
Yeah, it's coming up soon.

23:19.120 --> 23:21.000
I gotta do more too.

23:21.400 --> 23:22.930
Anyway, moving on.

23:23.420 --> 23:26.340
"Mie-san breaks her curfew, and..."

23:26.340 --> 23:27.880
Why?!

23:27.880 --> 23:29.570
She's not like that!

23:29.570 --> 23:30.550
What's wrong?

23:30.560 --> 23:40.060
Episode 11

23:30.560 --> 23:40.060
On the Day of the Cultural Festival,
The Girl I Like and I...

23:31.380 --> 23:32.480
Next episode:

23:32.480 --> 23:34.710
"On the Day of the Cultural Festival, 
The Girl I Like and I..."

23:34.710 --> 23:36.230
On the day of the cultural festival, what?!

23:36.230 --> 23:37.310
I'm worried about Mie-san!

23:37.310 --> 23:40.060
I'm worried about what's going to happen!
